# Documate — API CQRS features

- Features live under `Modules/{Core|FrontendSupport|External}/Features/{Name}/`
- Colocate Controller, Commands, Queries, Dtos
- Controllers: MediatR only — no DbContext/repos
- Never return Domain entities

Detail: `docs/architecture/patterns/cqrs-feature-slice.md`, `folder-structure.md`, `mediatr-conventions.md`
